<section class="process-section" id="approach">
 <div class="process-sticky"><div class="section-kicker mono"><span>THE WAY I WORK</span><span>01 → 03</span></div><div class="process-layout"><div class="process-copy"><p class="mono">FROM INTENT TO IMPLEMENTATION</p><h2>讓每一層，<br />都接得起來。</h2><p>產品、系統與使用者之間，<br />需要的不只是程式碼。</p><div class="process-meter"><span></span></div><div class="process-stages"><div class="process-stage"><span class="mono">01 / UNDERSTAND</span><h3>先理解問題。</h3><p>把使用情境轉成需求，釐清角色、流程與限制。</p></div><div class="process-stage"><span class="mono">02 / CONNECT</span><h3>把系統接起來。</h3><p>整合前端、API、資料庫與模型，讓每個環節能協作。</p></div><div class="process-stage"><span class="mono">03 / OPERATE</span><h3>讓產品持續運作。</h3><p>把部署、備份、監控與迭代，一起納入開發流程。</p></div></div></div><div class="process-diagram" aria-label="需求、介面、系統與資料逐層整合"><div class="layer layer-0"><span class="mono">01</span><strong>需求</strong><small>CONTEXT / PEOPLE</small></div><div class="layer layer-1"><span class="mono">02</span><strong>介面</strong><small>WEB / APP</small></div><div class="layer layer-2"><span class="mono">03</span><strong>系統</strong><small>API / AI</small></div><div class="layer layer-3"><span class="mono">04</span><strong>資料</strong><small>DATABASE / CLOUD</small></div><span class="diagram-note mono">CONNECTED BY DESIGN.</span></div></div></div>
